 4. ☎️ Pic du jour 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Photo: Doug Mills/The New York Times President Trump has a new Oval Office phone that says "The President," with a golden image of the White House and a scripted "Donald J. Trump." The phone has "45" and "47" branding for Trump, the 45th and 47th president.

 When asked about it yesterday by Fox News' Peter Doocy, Trump cracked : "You know who gave this to me? The phone company." The phone bears the logo of Cisco , the technology giant. See a close-up . 

 Photo: Kylie Cooper/Reuters The U.S. Mint yesterday began selling golden $1 coins featuring Trump's portrait. Go deeper . 

 
 
